# Vite writes a timestamped copy of the resolved config next to it on every
# `vite build` / `vite dev` start. It is a build artifact, never source — but it
# lands in the config's own directory, so it appears as an untracked file in
# exactly the place a reviewer is looking for real changes.
vite.config.ts.timestamp-*.mjs

node_modules/
dist/
